<p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">JPG, PNG ou WebP até 5MB. Formato 1:1 recomendado.</p>
<button class="mt-1 inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-1 text-primary hover:text-primary-container font-label-md text-label-md font-semibold self-center sm:self-start" type="button">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm">upload</span>
                  Carregar novo arquivo
                </button>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Pro-tip Banner -->
<div class="bg-surface-container-low rounded-xl p-space-md flex items-start gap-space-sm">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0">lightbulb</span>
<p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">
<strong class="text-on-surface font-semibold">Dica clínica:</strong> Fotos acolhedoras, com olhar direto e iluminação natural aumentam o contato inicial de novos pacientes em até <strong class="text-primary font-bold">64%</strong>.
              </p>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Professional CRP Registry & Session Conditions Card -->
<div class="bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-xl p-space-lg shadow-sm flex flex-col gap-space-md">
